@{
    Layout = null;
    ViewData["Title"] = "Sobre Tarefa";
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Sobre Tarefa - AppTask</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --about-ink: #172033;
            --about-muted: #718096;
            --about-brand: #5c5ce2;
            --about-brand-dark: #4747bc;
            --about-soft: #eeedff;
            --about-line: #e7ebf1;
            --about-background: #f6f7fb;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: var(--about-background);
            color: var(--about-ink);
            font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .about-page {
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 28px 20px 58px;
        }

        .about-container {
            max-width: 1120px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .about-nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 72px;
        }

        .about-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -.03em;
        }

        .about-brand-mark {
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            width: 35px;
            height: 35px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--about-brand);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(92,92,226,.24);
        }

        .about-back {
            color: var(--about-muted);
            font-size: .86rem;
            font-weight: 750;
            transition: color .16s;
        }

            .about-back:hover {
                color: var(--about-brand);
            }

        .about-hero {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 70px;
            margin-bottom: 74px;
        }

        .about-eyebrow {
            color: var(--about-brand);
            font-size: .74rem;
            font-weight: 850;
            letter-spacing: .14em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .about-hero h1 {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 12px 0 18px;
            font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 6vw, 5.2rem);
            line-height: .98;
            letter-spacing: -.075em;
            font-weight: 850;
        }

            .about-hero h1 span {
                color: var(--about-brand);
            }

        .about-hero p {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--about-muted);
            font-size: 1.08rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .about-hero-card {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 330px;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #5c5ce2, #4545b8);
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 24px 45px rgba(92,92,226,.23);
        }

            .about-hero-card::before, .about-hero-card::after {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
                border-radius: 50%;
            }

            .about-hero-card::before {
                width: 300px;
                height: 300px;
                right: -120px;
                top: -100px;
            }

            .about-hero-card::after {
                width: 210px;
                height: 210px;
                right: -65px;
                top: -55px;
            }

        .about-card-label {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            opacity: .75;
            font-size: .72rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: .12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .about-hero-card h2 {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 260px;
            margin: 72px 0 12px;
            font-size: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.05;
            letter-spacing: -.05em;
        }

        .about-hero-card p {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 275px;
            margin: 0;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .about-section-heading {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

            .about-section-heading h2 {
                margin: 0 0 7px;
                font-size: 1.6rem;
                letter-spacing: -.04em;
            }

            .about-section-heading p {
                margin: 0;
                color: var(--about-muted);
            }

        .about-feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .about-feature {
            padding: 23px;
            border: 1px solid var(--about-line);
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(33,47,77,.045);
        }

        .about-feature-icon {
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: var(--about-soft);
            color: var(--about-brand);
            font-weight: 850;
        }

        .about-feature h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .about-feature p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--about-muted);
            font-size: .88rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .about-footer {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--about-line);
            color: var(--about-muted);
            font-size: .82rem;
        }

            .about-footer strong {
                color: var(--about-ink);
            }

        @@media (max-width: 800px) {
            .about-hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 35px;
            }

                .about-hero h1 {
                    font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 12vw, 4.5rem);
                }

            .about-feature-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .about-nav {
                margin-bottom: 50px;
            }
        }

        @@media (max-width: 480px) {
            .about-page {
                padding: 20px 15px 40px;
            }

            .about-hero-card {
                min-height: 285px;
                padding: 22px;
            }

                .about-hero-card h2 {
                    margin-top: 62px;
                }

            .about-footer {
                align-items: flex-start;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 8px;
            }
        }

        @@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after {
                transition-duration: .01ms !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="about-page">
        <div class="about-container">
            <nav class="about-nav" aria-label="Navegação da página">
                <a class="about-brand" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index"><span class="about-brand-mark">A</span> AppTask</a>
                <a class="about-back" asp-controller="Tarefa" asp-action="Index">? Voltar para tarefas</a>
            </nav>

            <section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
                <div>
                    <div class="about-eyebrow">Sobre o módulo</div>
                    <h1 id="about-title">Tarefas com mais <span>clareza.</span></h1>
                    <p>O módulo de tarefas do AppTask foi criado para ajudar equipes a organizar atividades, acompanhar prazos e transformar planejamento em entregas reais.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="about-hero-card" aria-label="Resumo do módulo de tarefas">
                    <div class="about-card-label">AppTask · produtividade</div>
                    <h2>Menos ruído. Mais foco no que importa.</h2>
                    <p>Centralize responsabilidades, status e prazos em uma experiência simples de usar.</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="features-title">
                <div class="about-section-heading"><h2 id="features-title">Tudo em um só lugar</h2><p>Recursos pensados para tornar o acompanhamento diário mais simples.</p></div>
                <div class="about-feature-grid">
                    <article class="about-feature"><div class="about-feature-icon">01</div><h3>Organização</h3><p>Tenha uma visão clara de cada tarefa, seus prazos e o responsável pela execução.</p></article>
                    <article class="about-feature"><div class="about-feature-icon">02</div><h3>Acompanhamento</h3><p>Atualize o status do trabalho e identifique rapidamente o que precisa de atenção.</p></article>
                    <article class="about-feature"><div class="about-feature-icon">03</div><h3>Produtividade</h3><p>Reduza retrabalho e mantenha a equipe alinhada do início ao fim da atividade.</p></article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <footer class="about-footer"><span><strong>AppTask</strong> · Gestão simples, trabalho melhor.</span><span>© 2026</span></footer>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
